@startuml 07_level2_p6
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FEF3C7

title PPMP - Level 2 decomposition of 6.0
rectangle "All authenticated roles / login user" as U
rectangle "Auditor / Viewer" as V
usecase "1.0\nAuthenticate and Manage Access" as P1
usecase "2.0\nMaintain Planning Reference Data" as P2
usecase "3.0\nPrepare and Submit Department PPMP" as P3
usecase "4.0\nReview and Decide on Submitted Versions" as P4
usecase "5.0\nConsolidate and Produce Reports" as P5
database "D1 Identity and Access\nusers, departments, memberships, roles,\npermissions, role assignments, sessions" as D1
database "D7 Append-only Audit Log" as D7
database "D8 Event Outbox and Notifications" as D8
usecase "6.1\nPersist and Consume Committed Events" as P61
usecase "6.2\nRedact and Append Audit Entries" as P62
usecase "6.3\nResolve Recipients and Maintain Inbox" as P63
usecase "6.4\nAuthorize and Serve Audit History" as P64

U --> P63 : F051 Notification query / read acknowledgement\n[INBOX_QUERY]
P63 --> U : F052 Recipient notifications and unread count\n[INBOX_RESULT]
V --> P64 : F053 Authorized audit-history query\n[AUDIT_QUERY]
P64 --> V : F054 Filtered audit history\n[AUDIT_RESULT]
D1 --> P63 : F055 Recipient membership and audit permissions\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
D7 --> P64 : F056 Scoped audit entries\n[AUDIT_READ]
P62 --> D7 : F057 Redacted append-only audit entries\n[AUDIT_WRITE]
D8 --> P61 : F058 Committed events and recipient inbox records\n[OUTBOX_READ]
P61 --> D8 : F059 Committed events, inbox messages and read state\n[OUTBOX_WRITE]
P1 --> P61 : F060 Process 1.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P2 --> P61 : F061 Process 2.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P3 --> P61 : F062 Process 3.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P4 --> P61 : F063 Process 4.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P5 --> P61 : F064 Process 5.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P61 --> P62 : 6.01 Committed event for audit\n[COMMITTED_EVENT]
P61 --> P63 : 6.02 Committed event for recipient resolution\n[COMMITTED_EVENT]
P63 --> P61 : 6.03 Inbox query and acknowledgement\n[INBOX_QUERY]
P61 --> P63 : 6.04 Recipient-owned stored messages\n[INBOX_RESULT]
P63 --> P61 : 6.05 New messages and read-state updates\n[OUTBOX_WRITE]
P63 --> P64 : 6.06 Verified audit-reader authority\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
P64 --> P62 : 6.07 Audit-read trace\n[AUDIT_QUERY_EVENT]
legend bottom
Rectangle = external role; oval = data-transforming process
Cylinder = logical data store; arrow = named data payload
U groups all roles for shared login, reports and inbox functions.
Numbered process peers in Level 2 are outside the decomposed process.
Packet fields: FLOW_REGISTER.md; relationships: DATA_DICTIONARY.md
endlegend
@enduml
